<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 02:05:58 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>为什么我们还需要人类数学家？</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/why-do-we-need-human-mathematicians-anymore</link><description>控制人工智能的挑战将引发大量技术工作，寻找既有专业知识又有人性之爱的人才。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/why-do-we-need-human-mathematicians-anymore2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 02:05:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/why-do-we-need-human-mathematicians-anymore</guid></item><item><title>科学家称他们发现了“实验室小僵尸”——从海参中提取的看似不朽的组织</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-say-theyve-discovered-little-lab-zombies-seemingly-immortal-tissue-taken-from-sea-cucumbers</link><description>&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-say-theyve-discovered-little-lab-zombies-seemingly-immortal-tissue-taken-from-sea-cucumbers.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 01:50:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-say-theyve-discovered-little-lab-zombies-seemingly-immortal-tissue-taken-from-sea-cucumbers</guid></item><item><title>使用古巴裸盖菇提取物生物合成金纳米颗粒及其在 Neuro2a 细胞中的生物刺激评价</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/biosynthesis-of-gold-nanoparticles-using-psilocybe-cubensis-extracts-and-their-biostimulatory-evaluation-in-neuro2a-cells</link><description>应用于神经科学的绿色纳米技术为治疗中枢神经系统疾病提供了创新的解决方案。本研究报告了使用产生裸盖菇素的蘑菇 Psilocybecubensis 的提取物生物合成金纳米颗粒 (AuNP) 及其神经刺激潜力的评估。 AuNPs 通过 HAuCl4 的生物还原合成，并使用紫外-可见光谱、TEM、DLS 和 FTIR 进行表征。物理化学结果证实了单分散球形纳米粒子的产生，平均直径为18.94 nm，具有高胶体稳定性（zeta电位：-31.0 mV）。 FTIR 分析表明真菌代谢物构成了纳米材料的稳定有机冠。使用 IncuCyte® 实时监测平台和 3D 全息摄影显微镜在 Neuro2a (N2a) 神经元模型中评估生物活性。确定了剂量依赖性毒物兴奋反应：22.91 至 183.25 µg/mL 之间的浓度可诱导细胞增殖和活力显着增加，而不会影响形态学，而剂量 ≥ 733.0 µg/mL 会导致急性细胞毒性。 3D 全息断层扫描证实生物刺激治疗 (91.63 µg/mL) 促进细胞质延伸活跃的表型，与神经突生长的早期阶段一致。总之，P.cubensis AuNPs 构成了一种有前景的纳米治疗系统，具有神经保护和促增殖能力，为未来在再生医学和神经康复中的应用奠定了基础。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/biosynthesis-of-gold-nanoparticles-using-psilocybe-cubensis-extracts-and-their-biostimulatory-evaluation-in-neuro2a-cells.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 01:35:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/biosynthesis-of-gold-nanoparticles-using-psilocybe-cubensis-extracts-and-their-biostimulatory-evaluation-in-neuro2a-cells</guid></item><item><title>用于精确空间蛋白质靶向的亚细胞光化学</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/subcellular-photochemistry-for-precision-spatial-protein-targeting</link><description>传统的药物设计缺乏选择性靶向错误定位蛋白质所需的空间控制，这是疾病中普遍存在的现象。本观点讨论了亚细胞光化学如何与前药方法相结合能够精确地靶向那些保守的蛋白质。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/subcellular-photochemistry-for-precision-spatial-protein-targeting.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 01:20:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/subcellular-photochemistry-for-precision-spatial-protein-targeting</guid></item><item><title>谷歌的模拟果蝇大脑在网络浏览器中“挖掘比特币”概念验证——FutureBit 表示，真正的有机神经元挖掘器的效率可能是“最好的硅 3nm ASIC 的 10 倍”</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/googles-simulated-fruit-fly-brain-mines-bitcoin-in-web-browser-proof-of-concept-futurebit-says-real-organic-neuron-miner-could-have-10x-the-efficiency-of</link><description>玩《毁灭战士》、日间交易、飞行无人机、现在加密货币挖矿：还有什么是数字化苍蝇大脑无法做到的吗？ &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/googles-simulated-fruit-fly-brain-mines-bitcoin-in-web-browser-proof-of-concept-futurebit-says-real-organic-neuron-miner-could-have-10x-the-efficiency-of.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 01:05:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/googles-simulated-fruit-fly-brain-mines-bitcoin-in-web-browser-proof-of-concept-futurebit-says-real-organic-neuron-miner-could-have-10x-the-efficiency-of</guid></item><item><title>三星和摩托罗拉煮熟了苹果💀</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/samsung-motorola-cooked-apple-%f0%9f%92%80</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 00:50:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/samsung-motorola-cooked-apple-%f0%9f%92%80</guid></item><item><title>隆重推出新款 iPhone Duo</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/introducing-the-new-iphone-duo</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 00:35:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/introducing-the-new-iphone-duo</guid></item><item><title>量子与网络安全：威胁与机遇的双重要求</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/quantum-and-cybersecurity-a-dual-imperative-of-threat-and-opportunity</link><description>量子技术正在迅速改变网络安全，既带来了生存威胁，也带来了机遇。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/quantum-and-cybersecurity-a-dual-imperative-of-threat-and-opportunity.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 00:20:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/quantum-and-cybersecurity-a-dual-imperative-of-threat-and-opportunity</guid></item><item><title>皮质内微刺激：唤起人工感知并进行基于可塑性的调制</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/intracortical-microstimulation-evoking-artificial-perception-and-engaging-plasticity-based-modulation</link><description>但与大脑建立持久的电子连接是很复杂的。传统的微丝和硅电极比软脑组织硬得多。机械特性的差异可能导致与微运动相关的组织损伤、炎症和神经胶质疤痕形成。因此，研究人员正在从刚性电极转向灵活的仿生生物混合界面。这些较新的方法旨在减少植入设备和神经组织之间的机械和生物不匹配，同时保持记录和刺激神经活动的能力。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/intracortical-microstimulation-evoking-artificial-perception-and-engaging-plasticity-based-modulation2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 00:05:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/intracortical-microstimulation-evoking-artificial-perception-and-engaging-plasticity-based-modulation</guid></item><item><title>研究人员创造了无需电力即可执行 100 位计算的 DNA 计算机——分子系统使用自组装链来执行计算</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/researchers-create-dna-computer-that-performs-100-bit-calculations-without-electricity-molecular-system-uses-self-assembling-strands-to-perform-computing</link><description>梅努斯大学的研究人员建造了一台支架式 DNA 计算机，它利用分子反应进行算术和 100 位计算，无需电力。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/researchers-create-dna-computer-that-performs-100-bit-calculations-without-electricity-molecular-system-uses-self-assembling-strands-to-perform-computing2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 23:50:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/researchers-create-dna-computer-that-performs-100-bit-calculations-without-electricity-molecular-system-uses-self-assembling-strands-to-perform-computing</guid></item></channel></rss>